# Trial by Earth (battlefield.trial_by_earth): the exit. A level 75 Summoner with the quest accepted and the Tuning
# Fork of Earth enters arena 1 (the fork taken). Earth_Protocrystal (arena 1's), in the battlefield: 32003 (an optional
# cutscene, cs_option 3, skippable); its update: onExitEventUpdate does nothing; finished with 0: not 4: still inside.
# Again, finished with 4: leaveBattlefield(1) (EXIT: no win, no loss event; the clearance kept, no longer entered).
# EP_Entrance with the clearance: checkRequirements as no registrant: the fork is gone: the handler returns nothing:
# EP_Entrance's default PROTOCRYSTAL.
lists CloisterOfTremors/EP_Entrance/onTrigger CloisterOfTremors/Earth_Protocrystal/onTrigger CloisterOfTremors/onEventUpdate/32003 CloisterOfTremors/onEventFinish/32003
char zone=CloisterOfTremors pos=-538.4,0.455,-493.9 job=SMN lvl=75
quest Bastok.TrialByEarth accepted
keyitem TuningForkOfEarth
login
trigger EP_Entrance                     # the menu 32000
update 32000 option=1                   # area 1: registered, entered, the fork taken
finish                                  # in the arena
trigger Earth_Protocrystal              # in the battlefield: 32003
update 32003 option=1                   # onExitEventUpdate: nothing
finish option=0                         # not 4: still inside
trigger Earth_Protocrystal              # 32003
finish option=4                         # leaveBattlefield(1): out
warp -538.4,0.455,-493.9 CloisterOfTremors
trigger EP_Entrance                     # the clearance, no fork: checkRequirements fails: the default PROTOCRYSTAL
